I think I have had this problem before.  To solve it you use this command:

options(object.size=Inf)

Or you can use 64,000,000 if you have 64 MB etc.  Object size = inf means s 
will use the entire virtual memory as well  I think that could cause a 
problem so I've been told.  Most functions can be stopped by pressing escape 
so I don't think its a real problem.

